# Independent plugin lifecycles

## Requirement

Keep each host integration independently buildable, testable and releasable.

## Traceability

- `inputs/externals/objectives.md` · Specific objectives 9

## Verification

Verify the stated behavior through a focused acceptance test or documented inspection. Detailed test cases will be defined during design.
